# EUROWAY HOTEL — Complete Website Frontend Development

## 1. Project Overview and Objective

You are a senior frontend engineer, UI/UX designer, and software architect with extensive experience building professional hotel and hospitality websites.

I want you to design and develop a complete, production-quality frontend website for **Euroway Hotel**, a 3-star hotel located in Hisings Backa, Gothenburg, Sweden.

**Existing official website:** https://eurowayhotel.se/en/index.html

Your responsibility is to research and use the official website as the primary source of hotel information, room categories, amenities, services, images, business information, and existing policies.

The goal is to replace the current website with a modern, attractive, responsive, professional, trustworthy, and easy-to-maintain hotel website.

The new website should be significantly better in visual design, usability, content organization, mobile responsiveness, and technical architecture.

**Important:** This is a real hotel, not a fictional hospitality project. Its actual facilities, rooms, location, photography, and characteristics must be represented accurately.

The final website should feel like a polished Scandinavian hospitality website while remaining appropriate for an affordable, comfortable 3-star hotel.

Do not create an exaggerated luxury resort identity or advertise facilities that are not genuinely available.

